  ["/lvd: show or hide the window\n/lvd options: this window\n/lvd next, /lvd back: a step on or back\n/lvd report: report this step\n/lvd profs: professions\n/lvd line [name]: the start area of your route\n/lvd dungeons on|off, /lvd solo\n/lvd reset: start the route again from your level"] = "/lvd：顯示或隱藏視窗\n/lvd options：這個視窗\n/lvd next, /lvd back：前進或後退一步\n/lvd report：回報這個步驟\n/lvd profs：專業技能\n/lvd line [name]：你的路線的起始區域\n/lvd dungeons on|off, /lvd solo\n/lvd reset：從你目前的等級重新開始路線",
  ["; %d more spells are your choice (saving for riding)"] = "；另外 %d 個法術由你決定(存錢學騎術)",
  ["A Task Unfinished (Mulgore): Antur Fallow stands up in the hills west of Camp Narache, the straight way runs into the mountains (Daniel 11.10.)"] = "A Task Unfinished (Mulgore)：Antur Fallow 站在納拉其營地西邊的山丘上，直走的路會通往山區",
  ["A blue frame on the items in your bags that a later quest of the route still needs, so you do not sell them by mistake. The item's tooltip says which quest."] = "背包中有物品是路線之後的任務還需要的，會加上藍色邊框，避免你誤賣。物品提示會顯示是哪個任務。",
  ["A compass beside the current step that points to its place. With it on, Questdon's own arrow steps aside while Leveldon's window is open."] = "目前步驟旁邊的指南針，指向該步驟的地點。開啟時，Leveldon 視窗開著期間 Questdon 自己的箭頭會讓開。",
  ["A hint to light a campfire for the camp bonuses when you have the materials."] = "有材料時，提醒你生營火以獲得營地加成。",
  ["A marker over the head of the NPC or mob the current step is about."] = "在目前步驟所指的 NPC 或怪物頭上顯示標記。",
  ["About %.1f hours, %d quests handed in"] = "約 %.1f 小時，已繳交 %d 個任務",
  ["Accept"] = "接受",
  ["Along here: %s"] = "順路：%s",
